title":"Events","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/events"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger/acknowledge(_:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"acknowledge"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every destination has received the records at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"positions"},{"type":"text","text":", so the store can forget them."}],"required":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/acknowledge(_:)","type":"topic","title":"acknowledge(_:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/acknowledge(_:)"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Acknowledger","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Acknowledger","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What keeps records until their delivery is acknowledged: a store, as a delivery sees it."}],"role":"symbol","title":"Acknowledger","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger/records(at:)-4jg2u":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"records(at:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)-4jg2u","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"at"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","text":"EventRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/records(at:)-4jg2u","abstract":[{"text":"No records: a store that can’t read its records back keeps those of a batch a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination’s full buffer dropped for a later launch to deliver.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","title":"EventRecord","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A tracked event: the event itself, when it was tracked, where, and the context it was tracked in.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"identifier"}]}}}